{
  "total_ms": 48870,
  "total_chars": 205,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "A01",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "做了一辈子饭，多少人栽在洋葱手里：刀刚下去，眼泪先下来了。",
      "chars": 29,
      "speech_ms": 6840,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 6840,
      "trace_id": "074875f208d97365f469bf335edb6b5a"
    },
    {
      "id": "A02",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "这事儿怪谁？",
      "chars": 6,
      "speech_ms": 880,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 7240,
      "end_ms": 8120,
      "trace_id": "074875f8c6e8bdb3953a2ddd6438d998"
    },
    {
      "id": "A03",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "怪洋葱。",
      "chars": 4,
      "speech_ms": 820,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 8520,
      "end_ms": 9340,
      "trace_id": "074875fe88d9e133c54c3a7de40687b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "A04",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "洋葱一切开，里头的东西发生反应，冒出一股呛人的气，直往上冲。",
      "chars": 30,
      "speech_ms": 6590,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 9740,
      "end_ms": 16330,
      "trace_id": "07487605f4ec94f675819f22af28d23d"
    },
    {
      "id": "A05",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "眼睛受了刺激，就会流泪——流泪是眼睛在冲洗自己。",
      "chars": 24,
      "speech_ms": 5410,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 16730,
      "end_ms": 22140,
      "trace_id": "0748760b53bec7c844321bafbf2ec408"
    },
    {
      "id": "A06",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "想少受点罪，老辈人传下来几个土办法：一是切之前把洋葱泡一泡凉水；",
      "chars": 32,
      "speech_ms": 8080,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 22540,
      "end_ms": 30620,
      "trace_id": "0748761250eada7af0bcd350fab6347d"
    },
    {
      "id": "A07",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "二是刀沾着水切；",
      "chars": 8,
      "speech_ms": 1440,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 31020,
      "end_ms": 32460,
      "trace_id": "074876183cff0b26fc757035241626e1"
    },
    {
      "id": "A08",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "三是把洋葱先在冰箱里镇一会儿再切。",
      "chars": 17,
      "speech_ms": 3800,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 32860,
      "end_ms": 36660,
      "trace_id": "0748761e09346693cc653f9b0e0d96f8"
    },
    {
      "id": "A09",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "都不费事，管不管用，您下回切菜试一回就知道。",
      "chars": 22,
      "speech_ms": 4430,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 37060,
      "end_ms": 41490,
      "trace_id": "074876251542a2fffc03893996711d7f"
    },
    {
      "id": "A10",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "做饭这点小事，处处都是学问。",
      "chars": 14,
      "speech_ms": 2520,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 41890,
      "end_ms": 44410,
      "trace_id": "0748762b6af6056fe96f870ce0093f5f"
    },
    {
      "id": "A11",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "您切洋葱有什么绝招？",
      "chars": 10,
      "speech_ms": 1540,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 44810,
      "end_ms": 46350,
      "trace_id": "07487632983c91497f6c52edafecd202"
    },
    {
      "id": "A12",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "说出来让大家学学。",
      "chars": 9,
      "speech_ms": 1710,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 46750,
      "end_ms": 48460,
      "trace_id": "07487638b513f380cf96813ed8f97395"
    }
  ]
}